  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllInputs>Apply MD3 style to all vanilla input fields</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllInputs>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllInputsDesc>When enabled, all vanilla input fields (value fields, search bars, etc.) use the MD3 borderless style. Only the appearance changes; input behavior stays the same.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllInputsDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllButtons>Apply MD3 style to vanilla buttons &amp; checkboxes</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllButtons>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllButtonsDesc>When enabled, all vanilla buttons (confirm/close/load, etc.), checkboxes, tab pages and scrollbars use the MD3 rounded style. Only the appearance changes; clicking and interaction stay the same.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleAllButtonsDesc>
