  <ModernExpandMenu_SwitchStyleDesc>Display style of checkboxes/switches: Vanilla / MD3 sliding switch / Cyber (flowing neon border + grid + light sweep + shockwave). Applies to both the settings screen and the vanilla UI; the selector itself turns cyber when Cyber is selected.</ModernExpandMenu_SwitchStyleDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_SkipUploadWait>Skip upload waiting countdown</ModernExpandMenu_SkipUploadWait>
