  <ModernExpandMenu_SpaceOnlyPausesDesc>When enabled, the spacebar only pauses the game; pressing it again while paused will not unpause. Use other methods (pause button / menu) to resume.</ModernExpandMenu_SpaceOnlyPausesDesc>

