  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindows>Apply MD3 style to vanilla window borders</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindows>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindowsDesc>When enabled, all vanilla windows use the MD3 rounded card background with a primary-colored border. Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindowsDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommands>Apply MD3 style to command buttons (draft/resign/attack, etc.)</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommands>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommandsDesc>When enabled, the bottom command bar buttons (draft, resign, attack, and all gizmo buttons) use the MD3 rounded background. Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommandsDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSections>Apply MD3 style to menu sections &amp; list rows</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSections>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSectionsDesc>When enabled, vanilla menu sections and list blocks (drug/food policies, surgery list, ideology list, etc.) use the MD3 rounded card. Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSectionsDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleSchedule>Apply MD3 style to the schedule (time assignment) bar</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleSchedule>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleScheduleDesc>When enabled, the time assignment buttons in the Schedule tab use the MD3 pill style with the primary color for the selected one. Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleScheduleDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPane>Apply MD3 style to the inspect pane + fix bar overlap</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPane>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPaneDesc>When enabled, the bottom-left inspect pane content uses the MD3 card background, and the status bars no longer overlap the title area. Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPaneDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatistics>Apply MD3 grouped cards to the statistics page</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatistics>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatisticsDesc>When enabled, the History tab Statistics page shows the stats grouped into MD3 cards (basics/wealth/raids/casualties/ending). Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatisticsDesc>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeo>Apply MD3 style to the ideology menu (culture rows &amp; meme cards)</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeo>
  <ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeoDesc>When enabled, the Ideology tab culture rows and the meme cards use the MD3 rounded outline (primary for the selected one). Only the appearance changes.</ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeoDesc>
